    {
      "id": "XV0u4fDROo_sdbuD6CPCq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4047.149201299933,
      "y": 636.166474900396,
      "width": 426.53948974609375,
      "height": 108,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#099268",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 369723162,
      "version": 294,
      "versionNonce": 1121875718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1740885154443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We should iterate forward through both arrays\nWe should take into account the order at which\nwe iterate each of the pairs in our arrays.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We should iterate forward through both arrays\nWe should take into account the order at which\nwe iterate each of the pairs in our arrays.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "jorbB4ttcDrdDu824J1a6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4044.302438308863,
      "y": 784.7283027744039,
      "width": 887.118896484375,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 810466822,
      "version": 542,
      "versionNonce": 2126566682,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1740885171342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Iterate once through the range [0, max(len(nums1), len(nums2))-1]\n2. Iterate once through nums1, and then another time through nums2.\n\nIf we wanted to optimize for time complexity, we would follow strategy 1.\nIf we want to optimize for simplicity and to make our code easier to understand, choose strategy 2.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Iterate once through the range [0, max(len(nums1), len(nums2))-1]\n2. Iterate once through nums1, and then another time through nums2.\n\nIf we wanted to optimize for time complexity, we would follow strategy 1.\nIf we want to optimize for simplicity and to make our code easier to understand, choose strategy 2.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
